        },
        {
          "text": "Na noona akw’ũ, anene na anini, maũngeme mbee wa kĩvĩla kya kyeũ; na mavuku mavuanw’a: na ĩvuku yĩngĩ yavuanw’a, nayo nĩ ĩvuku ya thayũ: na ala akw’ũ masilĩlwa na maũndũ ala maandĩkĩtwe mavukunĩ asu, kwĩanana na meko moo. ",
          "type": "text",
